        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Shield-shaped firescreen made from blue, green, pink and cream satin and black velvet patchwork in the \"Tumbling Blocks\" design. Edged with silk fringe, twisted cord, and tassels in co-ordinating variegated colours. Mounted on an adjustable gilded brass rod with four hinges to enable it to be adjusted, with barley-twist rods and clamp to attach to a shelf or ledge."@en ;
